{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02860","headline":"安德山池宴集 · 李百药","name":"安德山池宴集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝宰论思暇，高宴临方塘。\n云飞凤台管，风动令君香。\n细草开金埒，流霞泛羽觞。\n虹桥分水态，镜石引菱光。\n上才同振藻，小技谬连章。\n怀音自兰室，徐步返山庄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李百药","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02860.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02860","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}